<title>USA: Morgan's Foods holders approve 1-for-6 split.</title>
<headline>Morgan's Foods holders approve 1-for-6 split.</headline>
<dateline>BEACHWOOD, Ohio 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan's Foods Inc said Tuesday its shareholders approved a 1-for-6 reverse stock split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the split will become effective on July 14.</p>
<p>Fractional share interest created by the reverse split will be settled in cash.</p>
<p>Morgan's Foods operates 40 KFC (Kentucky Fried Chicken) restaurants and six East Side Mario's.</p>
